Z||000013||frontal lobe||02-07-2001||12:16 PM||||Seanh, <P>Some things do look good from a distance but NOT close up.  I have seen TV anchor women wearing their make-up, and it looks good from a distance, but up close--GROSS!!<P>And that aerosolized dirt that people were selling for a while to "thicken" thinning hair and cover bald spots probably looked good from a distance, but up close people would say, "Hey, why do you have dirt on your head?"<P>So unless you can always park 300 feet away from everyone, DO NOT use the cheap wal-mart hubcaps.<P>Stimpy, somehow I missed out on the brawny paper towel sale on e-bay.  What was that all about??<P>Lethal injection kit.  If you buy it, how many legal uses do you get with it???  Then there is the problem of narrowing the list down...oh, just forget it. (joking of course)||||reg||1
